doksam-korean
=============

doksam-korean reads and compiles the mecab-ko-dic dictionary. The dictionary is not
included in this repository: scripts/fetch-ko-dic.sh downloads it, and
`search-server dict build` compiles it into a local file (dict/ko-dic.bin) that is never
committed. A compiled dictionary file is a derivative of mecab-ko-dic and carries its
license.

