The segmentation behavior (lattice construction, unknown-word handling, left-space penalty
rules, tie order) follows lindera 6.2 (https://github.com/lindera/lindera, MIT License) so
that indexes built with lindera's embedded ko-dic stay compatible. No lindera code is
included; the implementation was written independently from its documented behavior and
source.
